<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Painel Admin — Santa Fé</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: var(--sans); background: #E7E9EC; color: #161A1F; min-height: 100vh; }
    .topbar { background: #FFFFFF; border-bottom: 1px solid #D6DADF; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    .topbar h1 { font-size: 1rem; color: #B23227;  }
    .topbar a { color: #5B6573; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem; }
    .topbar a:hover { color: #1D3F94; }
    .topbar .left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; }
    .main { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem; }
    .tabs { display: flex; gap: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D6DADF; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; overflow-x: auto; }
    .tab { padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem; color: #5B6573; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; white-space: nowrap; }
    .tab.active { color: #1D3F94; border-bottom-color: #1D3F94; }
    .tab:hover { color: #161A1F; }
    .panel { display: none; } .panel.active { display: block; }
    .row { display: flex; gap: .75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .fg { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .25rem; min-width: 140px; flex: 1; }
    .fg label { font-size: .72rem; color: #5B6573; font-weight: 600;  }
    input, select, textarea { background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D6DADF; color: #161A1F; padding: .5rem .7rem; border-radius: 4px; font-size: .85rem; }
    input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus { outline: none; border-color: #1D3F94; }
    .btn { padding: .5rem 1rem; background: #1D3F94; color: #E7E9EC; border: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; font-size: .8rem; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; }
    .btn:hover { opacity: .85; }
    .btn.sec { background: transparent; border: 1px solid #C1C7CF; color: #161A1F; }
    .btn.danger { background: #B23227; color: #fff; }
    .btn.sm { padding: .3rem .6rem; font-size: .72rem; }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .82rem; }
    th { text-align: left; color: #5B6573; font-weight: 600; padding: .45rem .6rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #D6DADF; font-size: .7rem;  }
    td { padding: .5rem .6rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #D6DADF66; vertical-align: middle; }
    tr:hover td { background: #FFFFFF; }
    .muted { color: #5B6573; }
    .pill { display: inline-block; padding: .1rem .45rem; border-radius: 3px; font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 700;  background: #D6DADF; color: #5B6573; }
    .pill.ok { background: #1D7A4522; color: #1D7A45; } .pill.err { background: #B2322722; color: #B23227; } .pill.warn { background: #A8640022; color: #A86400; } .pill.info { background: #1D3F9422; color: #1D3F94; }
    .acts { display: flex; gap: .3rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .acts button { background: #D6DADF; border: 1px solid #C1C7CF; color: #161A1F; border-radius: 4px; padding: .25rem .5rem; font-size: .72rem; cursor: pointer; }
    .acts button:hover { border-color: #1D3F94; }
    .acts button.d { border-color: #B2322755; color: #B23227; }
    .card { background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D6DADF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .card h3 { font-size: .85rem; color: #1D3F94; margin-bottom: .75rem;  }
    .grid2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
    @media (max-width: 800px) { .grid2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    .alert { position: fixed; top: 1rem; right: 1rem; z-index: 200; padding: .7rem 1rem; border-radius: 6px; font-size: .85rem; display: none; max-width: 420px; }
    .alert.success { background: #1D7A45; color: #062; display: block; } .alert.error { background: #B23227; color: #fff; display: block; }
    .modal-overlay { display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,.6); z-index: 100; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
    .modal-overlay.active { display: flex; }
    .modal { background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C1C7CF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.25rem; width: 92%; max-width: 440px; }
    .modal h2 { font-size: .95rem; margin-bottom: .25rem; color: #1D3F94; }
    .modal .sub { color: #5B6573; font-size: .78rem; margin-bottom: .9rem; }
    .modal .fg { margin-bottom: .7rem; }
    .modal .actions { display: flex; gap: .5rem; justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: .75rem; }
    .pt-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: .5rem; margin-bottom: .6rem; }
    .pt-box { background: #F4F5F7; border: 1px solid #C1C7CF; border-radius: 8px; padding: .5rem .6rem; }
    .pt-k { color: #5B6573; font-size: .72rem; }
    .pt-v { color: #161A1F; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; }
    .pt-sec { margin-top: .5rem; }
    .pt-list { color: #2A3139; font-size: .82rem; margin-top: .15rem; word-break: break-word; }
    .stat { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: .8rem; color: #5B6573; }
    .stat b { color: #161A1F; }
    .empty { color: #5B6573; font-size: .85rem; padding: 1.5rem; text-align: center; }
    .clock { display: flex; gap: .5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .hbar { height: 6px; background: #D6DADF; border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden; width: 70px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: .35rem; }
    .hbar i { display: block; height: 100%; background: #1D7A45; }
    .picker { position: relative; }
    .picker-list { position: absolute; top: 100%; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 20; max-height: 220px; overflow-y: auto; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C1C7CF; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 4px; display: none; }
    .picker-list.open { display: block; }
    .picker-item { padding: .45rem .7rem; cursor: pointer; font-size: .82rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #D6DADF66; }
    .picker-item:hover { background: #D6DADF; }
    .picker-item .m { color: #5B6573; font-size: .72rem; }
    pre.det { font-family: inherit; font-size: .78rem; color: #5B6573; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; margin: 0; }
  </style>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/sf.css">

  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/Chart.js/4.4.1/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="topbar">
    <div class="left">
      <%- include('partials/placa') %>
      <h1>Painel admin</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="left">
      <a href="/dashboard">Corporações</a>
      <a href="/apuracao">Apuração</a>
      <span class="muted" style="font-size:.85rem"><%= user.discord_username %></span>
      <a href="/auth/logout">Sair</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="alert" class="alert"></div>

  <div class="main">
    <div class="stat">
      <span>Servidores online: <b id="st-servers">–</b></span>
      <span>Jogadores online: <b id="st-players">–</b></span>
      <span>Atualizado: <b id="st-upd">–</b></span>
      <span style="flex:1"></span>
      <span>Seu cargo: <span class="pill" id="eu-cargo">–</span></span>
    </div>

    <div class="tabs">
      <div class="tab active" data-tab="jogadores">Jogadores</div>
      <div class="tab" data-tab="registro">Registro</div>
      <div class="tab" data-tab="servidor">Servidor</div>
      <div class="tab" data-tab="logs">Logs</div>
      <div class="tab" data-tab="cargos">Cargos</div>
      <div class="tab" data-tab="usuarios">Usuários</div>
      <div class="tab" data-tab="historico">Histórico</div>
      <div class="tab" data-tab="analise">Análise</div>
      <div class="tab" data-tab="banidos">Banidos</div>
      <div class="tab" data-tab="pds">PDs</div>
      <div class="tab" data-tab="seguranca">Segurança</div>
      <div class="tab" data-tab="testers">Testers</div>
      <div class="tab" data-tab="royalties">Royalties</div>
      <div class="tab" data-tab="economia" id="tab-economia" style="display:none">Economia</div>
    </div>

    <!-- JOGADORES -->
    <div class="panel active" id="panel-jogadores">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="fg" style="max-width:320px"><label>Buscar</label><input id="pl-busca" placeholder="nome ou id"></div>
        <button class="btn sec" onclick="loadState()">Atualizar</button>
      </div>
      <div style="overflow-x:auto">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Jogador</th><th>Vida</th><th>Carteira</th><th>Banco</th><th>Emprego</th><th>Level</th><th>Posição</th><th>Ações</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody id="pl-body"><tr><td colspan="8" class="empty">Carregando…</td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="margin-top:1.25rem">
        <h3>Ação por Roblox ID (jogador offline)</h3>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="fg" style="max-width:220px"><label>Roblox ID</label><input id="off-id" type="number" placeholder="123456789"></div>
          <div class="fg" style="max-width:320px"><label>Motivo (ban)</label><input id="off-motivo" placeholder="Motivo do banimento"></div>
          <div class="fg" style="max-width:110px"><label>Duração</label><input id="off-dur" type="number" min="1" value="24"></div>
          <div class="fg" style="max-width:160px"><label>Unidade</label><select id="off-unid"><option value="h">horas</option><option value="d">dias</option><option value="p">permanente</option></select></div>
          <button class="btn danger" onclick="banOffline()">Banir</button>
          <button class="btn sec" onclick="unbanOffline()">Desbanir</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- REGISTRO -->
    <div class="panel" id="panel-registro">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="fg" style="max-width:320px"><label>Buscar</label><input id="rg-busca" placeholder="nome ou Roblox ID"></div>
        <button class="btn sec" onclick="loadRegistro()">Atualizar</button>
        <span class="muted" id="rg-info" style="font-size:.75rem;flex:1"></span>
        <button class="btn danger" data-poder="wipe" onclick="wipeGeral()" title="Reset brutal da temporada. Só o Dono."><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icones.svg#alerta"/></svg>Wipe geral</button>
      </div>
      <div class="row" data-poder="item_todos" style="gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#F4F5F7;padding:.5rem;border-radius:8px;align-items:flex-end">
        <span class="muted" style="font-size:.8rem;align-self:center"><b>Dar pra TODOS:</b></span>
        <div class="fg" style="max-width:170px"><label>Item</label><input id="dt-item" list="dt-itens" autocomplete="off" placeholder="item"><datalist id="dt-itens"></datalist></div>
        <div class="fg" style="max-width:70px"><label>Qtd</label><input id="dt-qtd" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="99"></div>
        <label style="font-size:.72rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.25rem;padding-bottom:.4rem"><input type="checkbox" id="dt-offline"> incluir offline</label>
        <button class="btn" onclick="darItemTodos()"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icones.svg#mochila"/></svg>Dar item a todos</button>
        <span style="width:14px"></span>
        <div class="fg" style="max-width:170px"><label>Carro</label><input id="dt-carro" list="dt-carros" autocomplete="off" placeholder="carro"><datalist id="dt-carros"></datalist></div>
        <button class="btn" onclick="darCarroTodos()"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icones.svg#carro"/></svg>Dar carro a todos</button>
      </div>
      <div class="row" id="rg-lote-bar" style="display:none">
        <span class="muted" style="font-size:.82rem"><b id="rg-sel-n">0</b> selecionado(s)</span>
        <button class="btn danger" data-poder="registro" onclick="apagarLote()"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icones.svg#lixo"/></svg>Apagar selecionados</button>
        <button class="btn sec" onclick="limparSel()">Limpar seleção</button>
      </div>
      <div style="overflow-x:auto">
        <table>
          <thead><tr>
            <th style="width:26px"><input type="checkbox" id="rg-all" onclick="toggleAll(this)" title="Selecionar todos"></th>
            <th>Jogador</th><th>Roblox ID</th><th>Visitas</th><th>1ª vez</th><th>Última vez</th><th>Status</th><th>Ações</th>
          </tr></thead>
          <tbody id="rg-body"><tr><td colspan="8" class="empty">Carregando…</td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="muted" style="font-size:.75rem;margin-top:.6rem">Item pra quem está <b>offline</b> entra numa fila e é entregue assim que a pessoa logar. Online recebe na hora.</div>
    </div>

    <!-- SERVIDOR -->
    <div class="panel" id="panel-servidor">
      <div class="grid2">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Hora do dia</h3>
          <div class="clock">
            <button class="btn sec" onclick="cmdServer('hora',{clock:6.5})"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icones.svg#amanhecer"/></svg>Amanhecer</button>
            <button class="btn sec" onclick="cmdServer('hora',{clock:12})"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icones.svg#sol"/></svg>Meio-dia</button>
            <button class="btn sec" onclick="cmdServer('hora',{clock:17.5})"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icones.svg#entardecer"/></svg>Entardecer</button>
            <button class="btn sec" onclick="cmdServer('hora',{clock:0})"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icones.svg#lua"/></svg>Noite</button>
          </div>
          <div class="row" style="margin-top:.75rem">
            <div class="fg" style="max-width:160px"><label>Hora (0–24)</label><input id="hora-custom" type="number" step="0.5" min="0" max="24" value="12"></div>
            <button class="btn" onclick="cmdServer('hora',{clock:parseFloat(document.getElementById('hora-custom').value)})">Aplicar</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Anúncio pra todos</h3>
          <div class="fg" style="margin-bottom:.6rem"><label>Título</label><input id="an-titulo" value="Aviso" maxlength="40"></div>
          <div class="fg"><label>Mensagem</label><textarea id="an-texto" rows="3" maxlength="300" placeholder="Texto do anúncio"></textarea></div>
          <div style="margin-top:.6rem"><button class="btn" onclick="cmdServer('anuncio',{titulo:document.getElementById('an-titulo').value,texto:document.getElementById('an-texto').value})">Enviar anúncio</button></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Clima</h3>
        <div class="clock" id="clima-btns">
          <button class="btn sec" data-chuva="-1" onclick="setClima(-1)"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icones.svg#ciclo"/></svg>Automático</button>
          <button class="btn sec" data-chuva="0" onclick="setClima(0)"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icones.svg#sol"/></svg>Sem chuva</button>
          <button class="btn sec" data-chuva="1" onclick="setClima(1)"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icones.svg#garoa"/></svg>Chuva fraca</button>
          <button class="btn sec" data-chuva="2" onclick="setClima(2)"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icones.svg#chuva"/></svg>Chuva média</button>
          <button class="btn sec" data-chuva="3" onclick="setClima(3)"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icones.svg#tempestade"/></svg>Tempestade</button>
        </div>
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:.78rem;margin-top:.5rem">Atual: <b id="clima-atual">–</b> · fica salvo (servidor novo já abre assim). <b>Automático</b> = chove sozinho de vez em quando, mais à noite; os outros fixam o clima.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card" data-poder="ssu">
        <h3>SSU — o servidor abre e fecha sozinho</h3>
        <div id="ssu-estado" style="font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;margin:.35rem 0 .15rem">–</div>
        <div id="ssu-quando" class="muted" style="font-size:.82rem">–</div>
        <div class="clock" style="margin-top:.7rem">
          <button class="btn" id="ssu-abrir" onclick="ssuAcao('abrir')"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icones.svg#cadeado-aberto"/></svg>Abrir SSU agora</button>
          <button class="btn" id="ssu-iniciar" onclick="ssuAcao('iniciar')"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icones.svg#play"/></svg>Iniciar SSU agora</button>
          <button class="btn danger" id="ssu-encerrar" onclick="ssuAcao('encerrar')"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icones.svg#parar"/></svg>Encerrar agora</button>
          <button class="btn" id="ssu-reabrir" onclick="ssuAcao('reabrir')"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icones.svg#atualizar"/></svg>Reabrir</button>
          <button class="btn sec" id="ssu-estender" onclick="ssuAcao('estender')"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icones.svg#relogio"/></svg>Estender</button>
        </div>
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:.78rem;margin-top:.7rem;line-height:1.5">
          <b>A grade é fixa e roda sozinha</b> — não dá pra editar por aqui, de propósito.
          <div id="ssu-grade" style="margin-top:.3rem"></div>
        </div>
        <div id="ssu-msg" class="muted" style="font-size:.78rem;margin-top:.5rem"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Servidores</h3>
        <div id="srv-list" class="muted" style="font-size:.82rem">–</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- LOGS -->
    <div class="panel" id="panel-logs">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="fg" style="max-width:180px"><label>Tipo</label>
          <select id="log-tipo" onchange="loadLogs()">
            <option value="todos">Todos</option>
            <option value="abate">Abates (derrubou)</option>
            <option value="morte">Mortes</option>
            <option value="tiro">Tiros (acertos)</option>
            <option value="entrou">Entradas</option>
            <option value="saiu">Saídas</option>
            <option value="admin">Ações admin (painel)</option>
            <option value="admin_jogo">Comandos admin (dentro do jogo)</option>
            <option value="kick">Kicks (todos os sistemas)</option>
            <option value="ban">Bans / desbans</option>
            <option value="seguranca">Segurança (anti-cheat/exploit)</option>
            <option value="acesso">Entradas recusadas</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="fg" style="max-width:260px"><label>Jogador</label><input id="log-q" placeholder="nome"></div>
        <button class="btn sec" onclick="loadLogs()">Filtrar</button>
        <span id="log-counts" class="muted" style="font-size:.75rem;flex:1"></span>
        <button class="btn danger" data-poder="logs" onclick="resetLogs()">Resetar logs (tipo selecionado)</button>
      </div>
      <div style="overflow-x:auto">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Quando</th><th>Tipo</th><th>Jogador</th><th>Alvo</th><th>Detalhe</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody id="log-body"><tr><td colspan="5" class="empty">Carregando…</td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CARGOS -->
    <div class="panel" id="panel-cargos">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Definir cargo em corporação</h3>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="fg" style="flex:2"><label>Usuário do site</label>
            <div class="picker"><input id="cg-user" placeholder="buscar por Discord, Roblox ou ID" autocomplete="off"><div class="picker-list" id="cg-list"></div></div>
            <div id="cg-picked" class="muted" style="font-size:.75rem;min-height:1rem"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="fg"><label>Corporação</label><select id="cg-corp" onchange="fillRanks()"></select></div>
          <div class="fg"><label>Cargo</label><select id="cg-rank"><option value="">Sem cargo</option></select></div>
          <button class="btn" onclick="setCargo(false)">Definir</button>
          <button class="btn danger" onclick="setCargo(true)">Remover da corp</button>
        </div>
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:.75rem">Se o jogador estiver online, o jogo atualiza a corporação dele em até 2 minutos (ou na hora, com o botão "Atualizar corp" na aba Jogadores).</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- USUARIOS -->
    <div class="panel" id="panel-usuarios">
      <div class="row"><div class="fg" style="max-width:320px"><label>Buscar</label><input id="us-busca" oninput="renderUsers()" placeholder="nome"></div></div>
      <div style="overflow-x:auto">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Discord</th><th>Roblox</th><th>Admin</th><th></th></tr></thead>
          <tbody id="us-body"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- HISTORICO -->
    <div class="panel" id="panel-historico">
      <div class="grid2">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Comandos enviados</h3>
          <div style="overflow-x:auto"><table><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Tipo</th><th>Alvo</th><th>Admin</th><th>Status</th><th>Resultado</th></tr></thead><tbody id="hist-body"></tbody></table></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Auditoria do painel</h3>
          <div style="overflow-x:auto"><table><thead><tr><th>Quando</th><th>Admin</th><th>Ação</th><th>Detalhe</th></tr></thead><tbody id="aud-body"></tbody></table></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button class="btn sec" onclick="loadHist()">Atualizar</button>
    </div>

    <!-- ANÁLISE -->
    <div class="panel" id="panel-banidos">
      <div class="row" style="margin-bottom:.6rem;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <b id="bn-conta">—</b>
        <span class="muted" style="font-size:.8rem;flex:1">Esta lista manda: o jogo confere ela na entrada de cada jogador. Banir/desbanir funciona mesmo com o servidor fechado.</span>
        <label class="muted" style="font-size:.8rem"><input type="checkbox" id="bn-hist" onclick="loadBans()"> ver desbanidos também</label>
        <button class="btn sec" onclick="loadBans()"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icones.svg#atualizar"/></svg>Atualizar</button>
      </div>
